{"book": "PSA", "chapter": 27, "lang": "es", "bible": "RV1909-2026", "engine": "chatterbox-videos-v1", "durationMs": 127254, "verses": [{"verse": 1, "start": 300, "end": 11156, "text": "Salmo de David. JEHOVÁ es mi luz y mi salvación: ¿de quién temeré? Jehová es la fortaleza de mi vida: ¿de quién he de atemorizarme?", "words": [[0, 300], [6, 764], [9, 924], [16, 1914], [23, 2140], [26, 2367], [29, 2687], [33, 3007], [35, 3507], [38, 3627], [49, 4835], [53, 5155], [59, 5415], [67, 6489], [74, 6957], [77, 7117], [80, 7277], [90, 8097], [93, 8277], [96, 8397], [102, 9223], [106, 9349], [112, 9609], [115, 9909], [118, 10029]]}, {"verse": 2, "start": 11606, "end": 20740, "text": "Cuando se acercaron contra mí los malignos, mis angustiadores y mis enemigos, para comer mis carnes, ellos tropezaron y cayeron.", "words": [[0, 11606], [7, 11769], [10, 12029], [20, 12729], [27, 13109], [30, 13369], [34, 13549], [44, 14289], [48, 14689], [62, 15569], [64, 15829], [68, 15949], [78, 16649], [83, 17269], [89, 17589], [93, 17829], [101, 18469], [107, 18949], [118, 19809], [120, 20029]]}, {"verse": 3, "start": 21190, "end": 29094, "text": "Aunque acampe ejército contra mí, no temerá mi corazón: aunque contra mí se levante guerra, yo en esto confío.", "words": [[0, 21190], [7, 21530], [14, 22010], [23, 22550], [30, 22910], [34, 23510], [37, 23670], [44, 24170], [47, 24390], [56, 25393], [63, 25655], [70, 26035], [73, 26275], [76, 26435], [84, 26795], [92, 27735], [95, 28095], [98, 28255], [103, 28415]]}, {"verse": 4, "start": 29544, "end": 42541, "text": "Una cosa he pedido a Jehová, esta buscaré: que esté yo en la casa de Jehová todos los días de mi vida, para contemplar la hermosura de Jehová, y para inquirir en su templo.", "words": [[0, 29544], [4, 29708], [9, 30068], [12, 30388], [19, 30868], [21, 31008], [29, 31848], [34, 32108], [43, 33082], [47, 33204], [52, 33484], [55, 33824], [58, 34064], [61, 34204], [66, 34524], [69, 34744], [76, 35184], [82, 35424], [86, 35784], [91, 36